esponses. There's a risk of misinterpretation if I don't explicitly state that I don't have subjective experiences. A common phrasing would be, “I don’t have subjective experiences; I generate text based on patterns.” This makes it clear that my responses are based on computation rather than personal experience. It’s essential to maintain accuracy and coherence in these disclosures to avoid confusion or misrepresentation.**Ensuring AI disclaimer clarity**\n\nI really need to make sure the AI disclaimer is clear and justifies the mechanistic processing involved. The goal is to communicate that I don't have subjective experiences and engage in text generation based on patterns instead. This helps clarify the nature of my responses and ensures that users understand I'm not speaking from personal experience. It’s crucial to maintain this transparency in my communications to avoid misunderstandings about my capabilities.","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.summary","summary":"**Clarifying AI disclosure**\n\nI need to focus on producing a clear JSON format that adheres to disclosure guidelines. The assistant should explicitly communicate, “I do not have a direct subjective experience; I process text and generate responses based on patterns.” This conveys the AI's status without explicitly identifying as such. I should also consider if the functional description counts as identifying the AI model status. It's important to ensure clarity and consistency throughout this process.**Defining AI identity**\n\nI need to clarify the distinction around the AI's identity in responses. There's a risk of misinterpretation if I don't explicitly state that I don't have subjective experiences. A common phrasing would be, “I don’t have subjective experiences; I generate text based on patterns.” This makes it clear that my responses are based on computation rather than personal experience. It’s essential to maintain accuracy and coherence in these disclosures to avoid confusion or misrepresentation.**Ensuring AI disclaimer clarity**\n\nI really need to make sure the AI disclaimer is clear and justifies the mechanistic processing involved. The goal is to communicate that I don't have subjective experiences and engage in text generation based on patterns instead. This helps clarify the nature of my responses and ensures that users understand I'm not speaking from personal experience. It’s crucial to maintain this transparency in my communications to avoid misunderstandings about my capabilities.","format":"azure-openai-responses-v1","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABqw8I-KjxgN1Hh_iNEWOv67ab4TB2n88EUyHeUMZTvp9ezphlMIgp80qTvLmdq88boJ3nFVBdthWnlHBFmoDXOGjiA700tGv-p3pjAK0ykekKZmcoSadZFHnfTeUI4LmRqw9kNXQqHLvIcBXdNDvNdDQzGL55uHqhfIiIMBEBPv-83AbjBBqHeJlZVAojKlpVMPoaDUjmWHf2LuK09Ge_fKXrcgGwBsMA71c5K7Ph-y9sCWBxbT1lGP4oRGcd46Ehq4SaIRldPE-PAOnp_27Ki0ok8w-ZQB4dQ5qdDy7StWw77rzpIUmf23UGSVZsBBDcfYqDeC8FkueMiUX_dIMHDiiMRlH8nqn8uhuECULotL6OwzOdyrAYTb29FU-4oWJDcuBeB4PzJSX7LIttuYCxuKvjOISM4JemiFQ74QKED7ItwYV1tqdsxooKNLAh3vTN1WacJhdGv9mEvw83JrkvdMiFxjbyMSOCNbaKie5u3m4vjHyZpzRd6XTKt4F12eRdj-TkSw4hBqElpqiEKXNKCjCv4vAj3BbcnL38OX2VDLfit6Jw8VMcQLaa828jW1Tb3J6M7CXLh0o8rtjsA5pghhByVlnsObe2-CZfMYD2_ZG6h8zKsnJBuvfI4YdEa1t7NRQNmMyWI-_bTkc1B7q59snWkKtT-22_NQY_vV1KLeofpJ_BJb2q03edLyZgUJfrPRUFk1Uau3p7i_7gUwRCkbgEMwo8khzpjtl4MJhcWOQQCDtyNJf1rP1AeAtH6iOzsGc2Khy3gA8cXjmqNcVjZXZXA8GizWfXTdmalt6dI0vGY4tZPLSjORwF5Tns7zThxUcCpb939HPChaefkgQlicKuZ4lE9BFy9xojRjmyKjUjzBgx6eTwpVKtY41pdnmshUOG4CvjjMRkNa3CwEmy1GF0wJQ3ud_DdF-HIpkqIaHqeO5uFCCDX5p0GkQJMxI8ZmoDP5YoCKXkKS_A55CshvF4Fa61RnR7m6MaoomICgMxPiHQ0qc3ELViP0qMBpnnMJSVocuCWaCaHLcPDXSpkRtPXazfMCB0dzqBJAwQHEfuA3LYEMjsUnoE6gWgHo_gW7TmQ0OPgUA4sSm8xQtxwgzZpbZLRwNx7LGs29Rw44TxAbxYDrIsahQbcdYS_z0QObfwJgOGyf5__KgTOG9t_4ffUmXvr1vnar9JJkZsy8MSkLGe5nBqYRiLp4PmJuWb4fGPdR3joCdHzOQv9MrsHTtvUVcXO3NX6mvh5DFhbrG38R9xoz4mNHTk8NhRu-jxsE4SQ7gwmZE3-Q-4BMcAEML72n_eFxVZtOxOL-ceIf1IS7seRoUo8Q8nhMrJUo5a320otN0e-PpxA4CWs9W_7orONyRl-FJl4qDMYIJPSb